    - title: Name
      value: Save the people trapped on the Swamp!
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Pictures
      value: '[]'
      type: 3
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
    - title: Description
      value: There are many people trapped in mini islands on swamp, find them and
        give this magic crystal, which makes them teleport to a safe place!
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Success Description
      value: Congrats! You saved everyone trapped on swamp!
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: Failure Description
      value: 
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
    - title: State
      value: unassigned
      type: 0
      typeString: CustomFieldType_QuestState
    - title: Is Item
      value: False
      type: 2
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Boolean
    - title: Description de
      value: "Es gibt viele Menschen, die auf kleinen Inseln im Sumpf gefangen sind.
        Finde sie und gib ihnen diesen magischen Kristall, mit dem sie sich an einen
        sicheren Ort teleportieren k\xF6nnen!"
      type: 4
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
    - title: Name de
      value: 
      type: 4
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
    - title: Description es
      value: "Hay muchas personas atrapadas en peque\xF1as islas en el pantano. \xA1Encu\xE9ntralas
        y dales este cristal m\xE1gico, que las teletransportar\xE1 a un lugar seguro!"
      type: 4
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
    - title: Description it
      value: "Ci sono molte persone intrappolate in piccole isole nella palude, trovatele
        e date loro questo cristallo magico, che le teletrasporter\xE0 in un luogo
        sicuro!"
      type: 4
      typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
