    - id: 24
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 3
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "See? It was not stolen! Next time, before accusing someone of doing
          bad things, it is important to be 100% sure, or you\u2019re going to hurt
          the other person with your unjust accusations!\u201D"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "Ves? no la hab\xEDa robado! La proxima vez, antes de acusar a alguien
          de haber hecho algo malo, es importante asegurarse al 100%, o herir\xE1s
          a las personas con tus injustas acusaciones!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Siehst du? Es wurde nicht gestohlen! Das n\xE4chste Mal, bevor Du
          jemanden beschuldigst, etwas Schlimmes getan zu haben, ist es wichtig,
          100 % sicher zu sein, sonst verletzt Du die andere Person mit Deinen ungerechtfertigten
          Anschuldigungen!\r"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Vedi? Non \xE8 stato rubato! La prossima volta, prima di accusare
          qualcuno di fare qualcosa di brutto, \xE8 importante essere sicuri al 100%,
          altrimenti ferirai l'altra persona con le tue accuse ingiuste!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "N\xE4etk\xF6 nyt? Ei sit\xE4 oltu varastettu! Muista olla 100-prosenttisen
          varma, ennen kuin seuraavan kerran syyt\xE4t jonkun tehneen jotakin pahaa.
          Muuten satutat toista ihmist\xE4 perusteettomilla syyt\xF6ksill\xE4si!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      conversationID: 18
