    - id: 30
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 6
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Now that you know what bullying does to people, you should apologise.
          How would you feel is it was you?
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "Ahora que sabes c\xF3mo afecta el bullying a las personas, deber\xEDas
          disculparte. \xBFC\xF3mo te sentir\xEDas si fueras t\xFA?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Jetzt, da Du wei\xDFt, welche Folgen Mobbing f\xFCr Menschen hat,
          solltest Du Dich entschuldigen. Wie w\xFCrdest Du Dich f\xFChlen, wenn
          Du es gewesen w\xE4rst?\r"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Ora che sai cosa fa il bullismo alle persone, dovresti scusarti .
          Come ti sentiresti se fossi tu?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Nyt kun tied\xE4t, miten kiusaaminen vaikuttaa ihmisiin, sinun pit\xE4isi
          pyyt\xE4\xE4 anteeksi. Milt\xE4 sinusta tuntuisi, jos se olisit sin\xE4?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      conversationID: 19
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 19
        originDialogueID: 30
        destinationConversationID: 19
        destinationDialogueID: 31
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 335.24716
