        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Remember what you have learned about being brief...Try again!
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: Recuerda lo que has aprendido sobre transmitir un mensaje breve...
          Intentalo de nuevo!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Erinnere Dich daran, was Du \xFCber das \xDCbermitteln einer kurzen
          Nachricht gelernt hast \u2026"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Ricorda cosa hai imparato riguardo al dare un breve messaggio\u2026"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Muista, mit\xE4 olet oppinut lyhyest\xE4 viestimisest\xE4..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
