        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: I don't think this is  fair, look at those people there, they are
          essentially the same as you and me...
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "No me parece justo, mira a esas personas de ah\xED, son esencialmente
          iguales que t\xFA y que yo..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Ich finde, das ist nicht fair. Sieh Dir die Leute dort an. Im Grunde
          sind sie genauso wie Du und ich.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Penso che questo non sia giusto, guarda quelle persone l\xEC, sono
          essenzialmente uguali a te e me.."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Minusta t\xE4m\xE4 ei ole reilua, katso noita ihmisi\xE4, he ovat
          pohjimmiltaan samanlaisia kuin sin\xE4 ja min\xE4..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
