    - id: 11
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: If someone thinks they are more important than others and provides
          several reasons for this, they are probably treating other people unfairly,
          as if they were less important
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "Si alguien se cree m\xE1s importante que los dem\xE1s y da varias
          razones para ello, probablemente est\xE9 tratando a los dem\xE1s injustamente,
          como si fueran menos importantes."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Wenn jemand meint, er sei wichtiger als andere und daf\xFCr mehrere
          Gr\xFCnde angibt, behandelt er andere Menschen wahrscheinlich unfair, als
          w\xE4ren sie weniger wichtig."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Se qualcuno pensa di essere pi\xF9 importante degli altri e fornisce
          diverse ragioni per questo, probabilmente tratta gli altri ingiustamente,
          come se fossero meno importanti"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Jos joku ajattelee olevansa muita t\xE4rke\xE4mpi ja perustelee sen
          useammalla tavalla, h\xE4n luultavasti kohtelee muita ihmisi\xE4 ep\xE4reilusti
          ja pit\xE4\xE4 heit\xE4 v\xE4hemm\xE4n t\xE4rkein\xE4."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      conversationID: 46
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
