    - id: 15
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "These people live among us without showing any interest in our language,
          culture and values. They are only interested in our resources\u2026  It's
          not like we have an infinite supply of everything! Do you think it's fair
          that they benefit from everything that we have built for us?"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "Estas personas viven entre nosotros sin mostrar ning\xFAn inter\xE9s
          por nuestra lengua, cultura y valores. S\xF3lo les interesan nuestros recursos...
          \xA1Ni que tuvi\xE9ramos un suministro infinito de todo! \xBFCrees que
          es justo que se beneficien de todo lo que hemos construido para nosotros?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Diese Leute leben unter uns, ohne Interesse an unserer Sprache, Kultur
          und unseren Werten zu zeigen. Sie sind nur an unseren Sachen interessiert
          \u2026 Es ist nicht so, dass wir von allem unendlich viel haben! Findest
          Du es fair, dass sie von allem profitieren, was wir f\xFCr uns aufgebaut
          haben?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Queste persone vivono in mezzo a noi senza mostrare alcun interesse
          per la nostra lingua, cultura e valori. A loro interessano solo le nostre
          risorse... Non \xE8 che abbiamo una scorta infinita di tutto! Pensi sia
          giusto che traggano beneficio da tutto ci\xF2 che abbiamo costruito per
          noi?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "N\xE4m\xE4 ihmiset el\xE4v\xE4t joukossamme osoittamatta kiinnostusta
          kieleemme, kulttuuriimme ja arvoihimme. He ovat vain kiinnostuneita meid\xE4n
          resursseistamme\u2026 Ei meill\xE4 ole tarjota \xE4\xE4rett\xF6m\xE4sti
          kaikkea mahdollista! Onko sinusta reilua, ett\xE4 he voivat hy\xF6ty\xE4
          kaikesta, mit\xE4 olemme meille rakentaneet?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      conversationID: 46
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
