    - id: 10
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Abundance in one place may mean scarcity elsewhere. Consider the distribution
          of resources and be mindful of those who may have less
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "La abundancia en un lugar puede significar escasez en otro. Considera
          la distribuci\xF3n de los recursos y ten en cuenta a quienes puedan tener
          menos."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "\xDCberfluss an einem Ort kann Knappheit an einem anderen Ort bedeuten.
          Bedenke die Verteilung der Sachen und sei aufmerksam gegen\xFCber denen,
          die weniger haben."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "L\u2019abbondanza in un luogo pu\xF2 significare scarsit\xE0 altrove.
          Considerare la distribuzione delle risorse e prestare attenzione a chi
          pu\xF2 avere di meno"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Ylt\xE4kyll\xE4isyys jossakin paikassa voi kieli\xE4 niukkuudesta
          jossakin muualla. Pid\xE4 mieless\xE4 resurssien jakautuminen ja ota huomioon
          ihmiset, joilla saattaa olla v\xE4hemm\xE4n."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      conversationID: 47
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 47
        originDialogueID: 10
        destinationConversationID: 47
        destinationDialogueID: 13
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 281.51065
        y: 553.9149
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 11
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "When there are a lot of resources in just one place or just one individual
          has more resources than they actually need, maybe there are other places
          where there are not enough resources or individuals who do not have enough\u2026"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "Cuando hay muchos recursos en un solo lugar o un solo individuo tiene
          m\xE1s recursos de los que realmente necesita, quiz\xE1 haya otros lugares
          donde no haya suficientes recursos o personas que no tengan lo suficiente..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Wenn es viele Sachen an einem Ort gibt oder nur eine Person mehr
          Sachen hat, als sie tats\xE4chlich ben\xF6tigt, dann gibt es vielleicht
          andere Orte, an denen nicht genug Sachen vorhanden sind oder Personen,
          die nicht genug haben\u2026"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Quando ci sono molte risorse in un solo posto o un solo individuo
          ha pi\xF9 risorse di quelle di cui ha effettivamente bisogno, forse ci
          sono altri posti dove non ci sono abbastanza risorse o individui che non
          ne hanno abbastanza\u2026"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Kun vain yhdess\xE4 paikassa on paljon ruokaa tai yhdell\xE4 on ruokaa
          enemm\xE4n kuin h\xE4n itse asiassa tarvitsee, on ehk\xE4 muita paikkoja,
          joissa ei ole riitt\xE4v\xE4sti ruokaa tai muita ihmisi\xE4, joilla ei
          ole tarpeeksi ruokaa\u2026"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      conversationID: 47
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 47
        originDialogueID: 11
        destinationConversationID: 47
