    - id: 18
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "I don't think this is fair, look at those people there, they\u2019re
          starving just because you have more than you need\u2026"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "No me parece justo, mira a esa gente de ah\xED, se mueren de hambre
          s\xF3lo porque t\xFA tienes m\xE1s de lo que necesitas..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Ich denke, das ist nicht fair, schau Dir diese Leute dort an, sie
          hungern, nur weil Du mehr hast, als Du brauchst\u2026"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Penso che questo non sia giusto, guarda quelle persone l\xEC, stanno
          morendo di fame solo perch\xE9 hai pi\xF9 del necessario..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Minusta t\xE4m\xE4 ei ole reilua, katso noita toisia ihmisi\xE4 tuolla,
          he n\xE4kev\xE4t n\xE4lk\xE4\xE4 vain, koska sinulla on enemm\xE4n kuin
          tarvitset\u2026"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      conversationID: 47
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
