        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: can you think of a way of getting more light in here?
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: Puedes pensar una manera de conseguir luz?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Kannst Du Dir eine M\xF6glichkeit vorstellen, hier mehr Licht hereinzulassen?\r\n"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Riesci a pensare a un modo per ottenere pi\xF9 luce qui?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Keksitk\xF6, miten saisimme t\xE4nne lis\xE4\xE4 valoa?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      conversationID: 49
