    - id: 1
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Hey, you're doing great, take this gift from me, I don't want anything
          in return, I just feel like doing it! Have a great day out here!
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "Eh! lo estas haciendo genial, toma este regalo de mi parte, no quiero
          nada a cambio, solo me apetece hacerlo! pasa un increible d\xEDa por aqu\xED!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Hey, du machst das toll, nimm dieses Geschenk von mir, ich will keine
          Gegenleistung, ich habe einfach Lust dazu! Ich w\xFCnsche dir einen sch\xF6nen
          Tag hier drau\xDFen!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Ehi, stai andando alla grande, accetta questo regalo da parte mia,
          non voglio nulla in cambio, ho solo voglia di farlo! Ti auguro una splendida
          giornata qui fuori!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Hei! Olet p\xE4rj\xE4nnyt hienosti, ota t\xE4m\xE4 lahja minulta,
          en halua mit\xE4\xE4n vastineeksi, haluan vain tehd\xE4 t\xE4m\xE4n! Viet\xE4
          upea p\xE4iv\xE4 t\xE4\xE4ll\xE4!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      conversationID: 52
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
