    - id: 5
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Great! Fear is useful when it helps us to protect ourselves from harm,
          but we must evaluate whether that harm is real and probable. When we are
          gripped by fear, we can become irrational and not be able to correctly
          read the situation...
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "Bien! El miedo es \xFAtil cuando nos ayuda a protegernos de alg\xFAn
          da\xF1o, pero debemos evaluar si ese da\xF1o es real y probable. Cuando
          el miedo se apodera de nosotros, podemos volvernos irracionales y tal vez
          evaluar la situaci\xF3n incorrectamente..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Super! Angst ist n\xFCtzlich, wenn sie uns hilft, uns vor Schaden
          zu sch\xFCtzen, aber wir m\xFCssen beurteilen, ob dieser Schaden real und
          wahrscheinlich ist. Wenn wir von Angst ergriffen werden, k\xF6nnen wir
          die Situation nicht richtig einsch\xE4tzen und handeln manchmal unvern\xFCnftig..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Fantastico! La paura \xE8 utile quando ci aiuta a proteggerci dal
          male, ma dobbiamo valutare se quel male \xE8 reale e probabile. Quando
          siamo presi dalla paura, possiamo diventare irrazionali e non essere in
          grado di leggere correttamente la situazione... Ti sentirai pi\xF9 equilibrato
          dopo\u2026 Continua cos\xEC!\r"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Hienoa! Pelko on hy\xF6dyllinen tunne, kun se auttaa meit\xE4 suojautumaan
          vahingoilta, mutta meid\xE4n on arvioitava, onko vaara todellinen ja todenn\xE4k\xF6inen. 
          Kun joudumme pelon valtaan, meist\xE4 voi tulla j\xE4rjett\xF6mi\xE4 emmek\xE4
          pysty lukemaan tilannetta oikein. Olosi on sen j\xE4lkeen tasapainoisempi\u2026
          Jatka!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
