      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: I made a terrible mistake in front of dozens of people, I feel totally
          ashamed!
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: Ostras! he hecho un error terrible delante de decenas de personas,
          mie siento totalmente avergonzado!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Ich habe vor Dutzenden von Leuten einen schrecklichen Fehler gemacht,
          ich sch\xE4me mich total!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Ho commesso un errore terribile davanti a decine di persone, mi vergogno
          tantissimo!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Voi ei! Tein kauhean virheen kymmenien ihmisten edess\xE4, olen todella
          nolo!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
