        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You are feeling Embarassment.... Embarrassment is a feeling of self-consciousness
          and awkwardness caused by a situation or action  that is socially questionable
          or a social mistake.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "Estas sintiendo verg\xFCenza... La verg\xFCenza es un sentimiento
          de timidez e incomodidad causado por una situaci\xF3n o acci\xF3n socialmente
          cuestionable o un error social.."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Du  f\xFChlst sich  peinlich.... Peinlichkeit ist ein Gef\xFChl der
          Befangenheit und des Unbehagens, das durch eine sozial fragw\xFCrdige Situation
          oder Handlung oder einen sozialen Fehler verursacht wird."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Ti senti in imbarazzo... L'imbarazzo \xE8 una sensazione di coscienza
          di s\xE9 e disagio causata da una situazione o un'azione socialmente discutibile
          o da un errore sociale."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Oletko Nolostuminen.... Nolostuminen on h\xE4millisyyden ja kiusallisuuden
          tunne, joka aiheutuu tilanteesta tai teosta, joka on sosiaalisesti kyseenalainen
          tai sosiaalinen virhe."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
