      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: I feel bad, my sister got a new phone, and I didn't...
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: Me siento mal, le han regalado un telefono nuevo a mi hermana, y a
          mi no...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Ich f\xFChle mich schlecht, meine Schwester hat ein neues Handy bekommen,
          und ich habe es nicht..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Mi dispiace, mia sorella ha comprato un nuovo telefono e io no...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Minusta tuntuu pahalta, siskoni sai uuden puhelimen, mutta min\xE4
          en..."
        type: 4
