    - id: 2
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 4
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You are feeling Guilt....  Guilt is a sense of responsibility or remorse
          when you have done something wrong, caused somebody harm or failing to
          meet your own standards.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "Estas sintiendo culpa...La culpa es un sentimiento de responsabilidad
          o remordimiento cuando has hecho algo mal, has causado da\xF1o a alguien
          o no has cumplido tus propias normas."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Du  f\xFChlst sich schuldig....  Schuldgef\xFChle sind ein Gef\xFChl
          der Verantwortung oder der Reue, wenn Sie etwas falsch gemacht haben, jemandem
          Schaden zugef\xFCgt haben oder Ihren eigenen Anspr\xFCchen nicht gerecht
          geworden sind."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Ti senti in colpa... Il senso di colpa \xE8 un senso di responsabilit\xE0
          o di rimorso che si prova quando si \xE8 fatto qualcosa di sbagliato, si
          \xE8 causato del male a qualcuno o non si sono rispettati i propri standard."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Tunnet syyllisyytt\xE4... Syyllisyys on velvollisuuden tai katumuksen
          tunne silloin, kun olet tehnyt jotakin v\xE4\xE4r\xE4\xE4, aiheuttanut
          jollakin harmia tai et ole onnistunut saavuttamaan omia mittapuitasi."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
