    - id: 6
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 4
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "Ok\u2026 No one likes to feel guilty\u2026 But it means that you
          care and you did wrong. And that you want to find a way to make amends
          or ask for forgiveness\u2026"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "Vale... A nadie le gusta sentirse culpable... Pero significa que
          te importa y que hiciste mal. Y que quieres encontrar la manera de enmendarlo
          o pedir perd\xF3n..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Okay... Niemand f\xFChlt sich gerne schuldig... Aber es bedeutet,
          dass Dir etwas wichtig ist und Du einen Fehler gemacht hast. Und dass Du
          einen Weg finden m\xF6chtest, es wiedergutzumachen oder um Vergebung zu
          bitten..-"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Ok\u2026 A nessuno piace sentirsi in colpa\u2026 Ma significa che
          ci tieni e che hai sbagliato. E che vuoi trovare un modo per fare ammenda
          o chiedere perdono\u2026"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Okei\u2026 Kenest\xE4k\xE4\xE4n ei ole mukava tuntea syyllisyytt\xE4\u2026
          Mutta tunne tarkoittaa, ett\xE4 v\xE4lit\xE4t ja teit v\xE4\xE4rin. Ja
          ett\xE4\r\nhaluat l\xF6yt\xE4\xE4 keinon hyvitt\xE4\xE4 tai pyyt\xE4\xE4
          anteeksi..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
