      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Wait a minute... could it be that the most precious thing to you...
          is your heart?
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "Espera un momento... podr\xEDa ser que lo m\xE1s preciado para ti...
          es tu corazon?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Moment mal... k\xF6nnte es sein, dass das Wertvollste f\xFCr Sie...
          Ihr Herz ist?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Aspetta un attimo... potrebbe essere che la cosa pi\xF9 preziosa
          per te... sia il tuo cuore?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Odota hetki... voisiko olla, ett\xE4 sinulle rakain asia... on syd\xE4mesi?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
