      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: you, little one, you have used the power of will to defeat me... what
          are you going to do with me now?
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "t\xFA, peque\xF1o, has utilizado el poder de la voluntad para derrotarme...
          \xBFqu\xE9 vas a hacer conmigo ahora?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Du, Kleines, hast die Macht des Willens benutzt, um mich zu besiegen...
          was wirst du jetzt mit mir machen?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Tu, piccoletto, hai usato il potere della volont\xE0 per sconfiggermi...
          cosa hai intenzione di farmi adesso?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Sin\xE4, pikkuinen, olet k\xE4ytt\xE4nyt tahdonvoimaa voittaaksesi
          minut... Mit\xE4 aiot tehd\xE4 minulle nyt?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
