        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "You are not stupid! Feeling stupid and being stupid are two very
          different things. If you need, I\u2019m willing to help."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "No eres idiota. Sentirse est\xFApido y ser est\xFApido son dos cosas
          muy diferentes. Si lo necesitas, yo puedo ayudarte."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Du bist nicht dumm! Sich dumm zu f\xFChlen und dumm zu sein, sind
          zwei sehr unterschiedliche Dinge. Wenn Du es brauchst, bin ich bereit zu
          helfen"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Non sei stupido! Sentirsi stupidi ed essere stupidi sono due cose
          molto diverse. Se hai bisogno, sono disposto ad aiutarti
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Et ole tyhm\xE4! Joskus voi tuntua silt\xE4, mutta se ei tarkoita,
          ett\xE4 oikeasti olisit. Voin auttaa, jos haluat."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
