        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "Your pet seems to be ok, you have to give it a pill every day for
          four days. You\u2019re a great friend for your pet!"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "Tu mascota parece estar bien, tienes que darle una pastilla cada
          d\xEDa durante cuatro d\xEDas. \xA1Has ayudado mucho a tu mascota!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Dein Haustier scheint in Ordnung zu sein. Du musst ihm vier Tage
          lang eine Tablette geben. Du bist ein gro\xDFartiger Freund f\xFCr Dein
          Haustier!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Il tuo animale sembra stare bene, devi dargli una pillola ogni giorno
          per quattro giorni. Sei un grande amico per lui!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Lemmikkisi n\xE4ytt\xE4\xE4 olevan kunnossa. Anna sille yksi tabletti
          p\xE4iv\xE4ss\xE4 nelj\xE4n p\xE4iv\xE4n ajan. Pid\xE4t hyv\xE4\xE4 huolta
          lemmikist\xE4si!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
