      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Your friend thinks that is it not worth putting so much effort into
          something where you have high chances to fail
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: Piensa que no vale la pena esforzarse tanto en algo en lo que tienes
          muchas posibilidades de fracasar.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Dein Freund denkt, dass es nicht wert ist, so viel M\xFChe in etwas
          zu stecken, bei dem man hohe Chancen hat, zu scheitern"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Il tuo amico pensa che non valga la pena impegnarsi cos\xEC tanto
          in qualcosa in cui hai alte probabilit\xE0 di fallire."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "H\xE4n ajattelee, ettei kannata yritt\xE4\xE4, jos voi ep\xE4onnistua"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
